{"step_index":9356,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T11:40:34Z","thinking":"Examining the mismatches, the first instance involves differing brands of the same medication, with ChatGPT incorrectly matching a generic to the original. This violates the initial matching criterion.\n\n\nThe next two cases highlight different drug forms (cream vs. suppository, spray vs. gel), which necessitate review despite the same active ingredient.  Further mismatches include brand variations and, crucially, a lethal drug error and mismatches of active ingredients, confirming the initial hypothesis of critical matching flaws. The pattern of mismatches involving distinct brands and active ingredient errors reinforces the need for stricter matching criteria.\n\n\nChatGPT's pattern of errors continues, consistently confusing distinct brands. Dosage form distinctions are also missed, leading to incorrect matches. The crucial need for rigorous brand and form verification is reinforced by these observations.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Forensic search across all 2,717 warehouse items for every Not Found item","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import json\nimport re\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom rapidfuzz import fuzz\n\n# 1. Load warehouse catalog items from cache\nCACHE_DIR = Path(r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\data\\cache\")\nwarehouse_items = {}\n\nfor f in CACHE_DIR.glob(\"*_extracted.json\"):\n    wh_name = f.name.replace(\"_extracted.json\", \"\")\n    with open(f, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fp:\n        raw = json.load(fp)\n        items = raw if isinstance(raw, list) else raw.get(\"items\", [])\n        warehouse_items[wh_name] = [\n            it.get(\"item_name_raw\", \"\").strip() if isinstance(it, dict) else str(it).strip()\n            for it in items if it\n        ]\n\nprint(\"=== LOADED WAREHOUSE CATALOGS ===\")\nfor wh, items in warehouse_items.items():\n    print(f\"  {wh}: {len(items)} items\")\n\n# 2. Load Not Found items from PROC-015\nwith open(r\"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\extracted_4way_data.json\", \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fp:\n    full_data = json.load(fp)\n\nnf_items = [row[\"اسم الصنف\"].strip() for row in full_data[\"PROC-015\"][\"not_found\"] if row.get(\"اسم الصنف\")]\nprint(f\"\\nTotal Not Found items in PROC-015 to audit: {len(nf_items)}\")\n\n# 3. Normalization helpers\ndef super_norm(s):\n    s = s.lower()\n    for e, w in zip('٠١٢٣٤٥٦٧٨٩', '0123456789'):\n        s = s.replace(e, w)\n    # Normalize arabic/persian letters\n    rep = {\n        'أ': 'ا', 'إ': 'ا', 'آ': 'ا', 'ى': 'ي', 'ئ': 'ي', 'ی': 'ي',\n        'ة': 'ه', 'گ': 'ك', 'ک': 'ك', 'پ': 'ب', 'ژ': 'ز', 'چ': 'ج',\n        'ڤ': 'ف', 'ف': 'ف', 'ؤ': 'و', 'ء': '', 'ـ': ''\n    }\n    for k, v in rep.items():\n        s = s.replace(k, v)\n    s = re.sub(r'[^a-z0-9\\u0600-\\u06FF\\s]', ' ', s)\n    return re.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', s).strip()\n\ndef extract_brand_token(s):\n    norm = super_norm(s)\n    # remove common dosage words\n    dosage_words = {'اقراص', 'قرص', 'كبسول', 'كبسولة', 'شريط', 'امبول', 'حقن', 'نقط', 'قطرة', 'شراب', 'معلق', 'كريم', 'مرهم', 'جل', 'سبراي', 'بخاخ', 'اكياس', 'كيس', 'س', 'ج', 'جديد', 'سعر', 'قديم', 'باكت', 'باكو', 'كرتونة', 'مل', 'ملل', 'جم', 'جرام', 'مجم', 'مج', 'مكجم'}\n    tokens = [w for w in norm.split() if w not in dosage_words and not w.isdigit()]\n    return tokens[0] if tokens else \"\"\n\n# 4. Forensic Search\npotential_discoveries = []\n\nfor shortage in nf_items:\n    brand = extract_brand_token(shortage)\n    if not brand or len(brand) < 3:\n        continue\n        \n    norm_req = super_norm(shortage)\n    \n    for wh, items in warehouse_items.items():\n        for cand in items:\n            norm_cand = super_norm(cand)\n            cand_brand = extract_brand_token(cand)\n            if not cand_brand:\n                continue\n                \n            # Direct brand substring\n            if brand in norm_cand or cand_brand in norm_req:\n                sim = max(fuzz.ratio(brand, cand_brand), fuzz.token_set_ratio(norm_req, norm_cand))\n                if sim >= 70:\n                    potential_discoveries.append({\n                        \"shortage\": shortage,\n                        \"warehouse\": wh,\n                        \"warehouse_item\": cand,\n                        \"sim\": sim,\n                        \"reason\": f\"Substring match '{brand}' in '{cand}'\"\n                    })\n                    continue\n                    \n            # High fuzzy ratio on brand\n            b_sim = fuzz.ratio(brand, cand_brand)\n            if b_sim >= 75 and len(brand) >= 4 and len(cand_brand) >= 4:\n                potential_discoveries.append({\n                    \"shortage\": shortage,\n                    \"warehouse\": wh,\n                    \"warehouse_item\": cand,\n                    \"sim\": b_sim,\n                    \"reason\": f\"Brand fuzzy match ({b_sim}%): '{brand}' vs '{cand_brand}'\"\n                })\n\n# Deduplicate by (shortage, warehouse, warehouse_item)\nunique_discoveries = {}\nfor d in potential_discoveries:\n    k = (d[\"shortage\"], d[\"warehouse\"], d[\"warehouse_item\"])\n    if k not in unique_discoveries or d[\"sim\"] > unique_discoveries[k][\"sim\"]:\n        unique_discoveries[k] = d\n\nresults = list(unique_discoveries.values())\nresults.sort(key=lambda x: x[\"sim\"], reverse=True)\n\nprint(f\"\\n=== POTENTIAL HIDDEN DISCOVERIES FOUND: {len(results)} ===\")\nfor r in results[:50]:\n    print(f\"[{r['warehouse']}] Shortage: '{r['shortage']}' -> Candidate: '{r['warehouse_item']}' ({r['reason']})\")\n\nwith open(r\"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\forensic_not_found_results.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fp:\n    json.dump(results, fp, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n","Description":"Forensic search script for Not Found items","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\scratch\\forensic_not_found_audit.py","toolAction":"Writing script","toolSummary":"Forensic search script for Not Found items"}}]}
